ound","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An experienced crew member who has worked on many films. He knows how to use his boom pole, and thrusts it anywhere he can get sound from.","abilities":["When outside the Filming Area, attacks inflict Nervous Impairment"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":5000,"atk":400,"def":150,"res":15,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"artistic_extra":{"slug":"artistic_extra","name":"Artistic Extra","icon":"/enemies-icons/Artistic Extra.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"An extra holding a clapperboard and pretending to be part of the crew. He is not chasing a dream, just doing it for fun. He likes to hear the audience's screams, caring little about what he is doing in front of the camera.","abilities":["Can only be blocked by allied units inside the Filming Area"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.3,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":100,"def":250,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":2}},"anguished_designer":{"slug":"anguished_designer","name":"Anguished Designer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Anguished Designer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A designer who always misses his deadlines. He will do whatever it takes to escape attention when he finds that he has accidentally entered the shot.","abilities":["Takes less Physical/Arts damage from the front","Afraid to face the camera. Turns around if facing the camera in the Filming Area","Inflicts Nervous Impairment on blocker when blocked"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":13000,"atk":400,"def":650,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1}},"sentient_