and has already angrily thrown film at whoever is nearest.","abilities":["Starts with 5 Film, firing them as ranged attacks. Performs melee attacks when out of Film or blocked","Film explodes when it hits an allied unit or reaches the target location, dealing damage and inflicting Nervous Impairment, and dealing splash damage and inflicting Nervous Impairment on nearby allied units","Film must be attacked 10 times to defeat","Film flies much slower when inside the Filming Area"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":45000,"atk":1400,"def":300,"res":40,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5}},"tragodia":{"slug":"tragodia","name":"'Tragodia'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Tragodia'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Death is ever-present, and drama is eternal.","abilities":["[Unrealized] Takes greatly reduced Physical and Arts damage when attacked by your units located outside the Filming Area","[Interest Piqued] After a few attacks, the next attack gains increased ATK","First Form","[Dramatization] Whenever a Nervous Impairment burst occurs on one of your units, deals damage to the units in the 4 adjacent tiles around that unit after a short delay, inflicting Nervous Impairment","[Diffusing Absurdity] Creates a barrier on 1 camera (prioritizing active ones), disabling it. Barrier explodes if not destroyed within a time limit, dealing damage to your units in the 8 surrounding tiles","Second Form","[Dramatization] Whenever a Nervous Impairment burst occurs on one of your units, deals damage to the units in the 8 adjacent tiles around that unit after a short delay, inflicting Nervous Impairment","[Diffusing Absurdity] Creates a barrier on 2 cameras (prioritizing active ones), disabling them. Barrier explodes if not destroyed within a time limit, dealing damage to your units in the 8 surrounding tiles","[Ceaseless Int